<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Ephesate</book>
  <para style="h">Ephesate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesate</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesate</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian deihlama Khrist Jesu sawltak in, misiangthou Ephesa khua a om Khrist Jesu a mi ginomte kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist Pa leh Pathian phat in om hen. Aman vanmunte ah khalam vualzawlna chiteng in eite Khrist ah a hon vualzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah mai a siangthou leh dembei a om ding a leitung pian ma a eite hon teltak bang ngei in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman a deih leh a tup bangbang in, eite Jesu Khrist vanga a tate hi ding in, itna ziak in hon sepkhol khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi a it a a honpiak hehpihna thupi mahmah pahtawina i hihtheihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sisan ziak in Amah ah tatkhiakna, a hehpihna hauhdan bang a i tatleknate ngaihdamna ngei i tangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hehpihna chillou hial in aman eite a honpeta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thiltup Khrist a a gelkhiak bangbang in a deihlam thuguk pilna leh theihsiamna ngen in eite hon theisakta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai a deihlam thilgel bel; hunbi hong kim chiang a, thil tengteng, van a omte leh leitung a omte Khrist a gawmkhawm a a suktuah vek ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah deihlama lunggel bang a thilbangkim semkhepa tup bang ngei in, amah mah ah sehkholh a om in i gouluah ding i muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koute, Khrist a a na lamen masate, a thupina pahtawina ding a hing ding in sehkholh in ka na omkhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan noute’n thutak thu, na hotdamna Tanchinhoih uh ngaikhia a na gintak nung un amah ah chiamsa Kha Siangthou a chiamteh in na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai Kha Siangthou bel, i gouluah ding tatna kim i luah mateng a, Pathian thupina ding a khamna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in ken leng Toupa Jesu a ginna na lak ua om leh misiangthoute tengteng tung a na itna uh ka zak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thumnate ah na min uh lou in nou ziak a kipahthu gen ka tawp kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist Pathian, thupina Pa’n, Amah theihna lamthu a pilna leh kilakna kha nou a honpiak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi a na lungsim mitte uh hihvak a hongom a, Aman nou a honsapna lametna bang leh misiangthoute a gouluah hauhsaknate na theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan a gingta eite a thilhihtheihna thupina tehvuallouh, huai a hatna thilhihtheihna toh a sep bangzel in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua thilhihtheihna bel Khrist misi lak a kipan a a kaihthoh a, vanmun a, a taklam a a tutsak hun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalnate, thuneihnate, thilhihtheihnate, vaihawmna tengteng tung leh tu khovel kia hilou a khovel hongtung ding nangawn a minsak chiteng tunglam pek ah a koihlai a a zatmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman bangkim a khenuai ah a koih a, amah bangkim tung a Saptuam lutang in a bawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai saptuam a sapum ahi a, amah bangkim a bangkim hihdimpa tangchinna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou leng na tatlekna uleh na khelhnate uh ziak a si na hihlai un a hon hihhing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaite ah tuma lam in hiai khovel dan bang in, huihkhua a thuneipa, tua thumanglou tate sung a semlelpa kha deihdanin na khosa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai thumanglou tate lak ah eite leng tuma lam in sa duhgawlna hih in, i sa utnate bang in i omvek ua, midangte mah bang in thangpaihna ta a piang i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh hehpihna hau Pathian in, itna thupitak a hon it ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tatleknate ziak a si i hihlai in Khrist toh a hon hihhinga, hehpihna a hotdam na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist Jesu ah amah toh a hon kaithou a, vanmunte ah amah kiang ah a hon tusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi a hun hongtung dingte a, Khrist Jesu a i tung a migitna nei a, a hehpihna hauhdan a etsak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hehpihna ziak a ginna tawn a hotdam na hi uhi; huai leng noumau a suak ahi kei a, Pathian thilthawnpiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilhih ziak a hi kei, huchi kei leh min a suang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil hoih hihding a Khrist Jesu ah siam a om in, amah khutsuak i hi uhi; huai thil hoih hih i khosakna dan ding in Pathian in a bawlkhol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuma lam a nou sa a Jentelte, sa khut a zeksum, a chihte un zeksumlouh hon chihte uh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailai in, Khrist lou in Israelte khua leh tui toh ki midang in khovel ah lametna neilou leh Pathian lou a om in, thuchiam thukhun lak ah mikhual in na om uh chih theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tun bel, Khrist Jesu ah nou nidanglai a gamlapi a omte, Khrist sisan a hihnai in na hong omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah i kilemna ahi; aman ei nihte khat a siam in i kikal a kimelmakna banglai a hihchimta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thusehte leh danthupiakte a sa a hihmang in; huchi a nihte Amah a mihing thak khat a siam a kilemna a bawl theihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan Kros ziak a nihte pumpi khat a Pathian toh hon kilemsakna ding in kimelmakna a hihbeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan a hongpai in, nou gamlapi a omte kiang ah leh naichik a omte kiang ah leng lemna Tanchinhoih a hilh sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah ziak in kha khat a Pa kiang luttheihna i nei tuaktuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in tu’n zaw, zin leh leng na hi nawnta kei ua, misiangthoute toh tualsung khat leh Pathian inkuanpihte na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khrist Jesu ngei a ning a suang kiphamoh pen hi in, sawltakte leh zawlneite suangphum tung a lam na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah ah suanglep tuam chiat kituaktaka suktuah in, Toupa ah tempul siangthou a suak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah ngei ah nou leng, Kha a Pathian tenna ding a lepkhawm na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaiziakin kei Paul, nou Jentelte ziak a Khrist Jesu hentapa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou ading a Pathian hehpihna nasepna piak a ka omdan na za thamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi a kilakna tungtawn a Khrist thuguk ka kiang a theihsaka a omdan, tuma a tomchika ka gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai na sim un Khrist thuguk ka theihdan na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu hun a a sawltak siangthoute leh a zawlnei siangthoute kiang ah Kha theihsaka a om bang in, tuma lam in mihing tate kiang ah theihsakin a om ngeikei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai thuguk hiai ahi, Tanchinhoih ziak in Khrist Jesu ah, Jentelte gouluahpihte, pumpi hiangte, leh thuchiam tanpihte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thilhihtheihna nasepdan bang a, a thawnpiak Pathian hehpihna bangzel in huai Tanchinhoih nasemtu ding a bawl ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei, misiangthou tengteng a neupen sang a neuzaw kiang ah hiai hehpihna piak ahi: Khrist hauhsakna suikhiak vuallouh Jentelte kiang a gen ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Pathian thil bangkim siampa a tangtawn a sel a na om, thuguk kisel bang ahia chih mi tengteng musak ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian pilna chiteng van munte a kumpi vaihawmte leh thuneihnate kiang a saptuamte zang a, tu hun a theihsak a hihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai a tangtawn thiltup dungzui a Toupa Khrist Jesu a a tup leh sepdan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khrist Jesu i gin ziak in amah mah ah maingalna leh hangsantaka luttheihna i nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in noute ziak a ka gimthuak ziak in lungkelou ding in ka hon ngen hi, huaite na thupina uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in i Toupa Jesu Khrist Pa ma ah ka khukdin hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei leh van a inkuan chiteng min phuahkhiakna pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thupina hauhdan bangzel a, a Kha ziak a mihing sunglam a thilhihtheihna a hihhat a a hon omsak theihna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan na lungtang ua Khrist ginna a a ten theihna ding in, nou a itna a zungkai leh kingakna nei a na om theihna ding un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Misiangthou tengteng toh a zatdan, a saudan, a sandan, leh a thukdan theihchian theihna leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khrist itna theih phaklouh, Pathian tangchinna chiteng bang a hihdim a na om theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan eimah a semzel thilhihtheihna bang in, i nget leh i ngaihtuah tengteng sang a thupi zawtham hihtheipa kiang ngei ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tangtawn in suan tengteng tan in, saptuamte leh Khrist Jesu ah thupina om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in noute sap a na omna utoh kikhawm a khosa ding in kei Toupa a hentapa in k’on ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kingaihniamna leh migitna tengteng, thuaktheihna toh, itna a kithuakzou chiat in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lemna Kha a kipumkhatna vom chinten ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A honsapna pen lametna mun khat a sap na hih mah bang un sapum khat leh Kha khat kia a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa khat, ginna khat, baptisma khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkim Pathian leh Pa khat kia a om a; amah bangkim tung ah a om a, bangkim a mu suak a, bangkim sung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Khrist thilpiak tehna bangzel in hehpihna i kiang chiat uah piak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Huaiziak in ahi, tunglam a a kahtouh lai in matte tampi a pi a, mihingte kiang ah leng thilpiakte a pia,” a chihna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in “A kahtou” chih lei mun nuainung pente bang a a hongsuk masak phot kei leh bangchi ahita dia le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hongsuk pen thil tengteng a hihdim theihna ding in, van tengteng tung pek a kahtoupa mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan khenkhatte Sawltak hi ding in, khenkhatte zawlnei hi ding in, khenkhatte Tanchinhoih gen ding in, khenkhatte Pastor hi ding in, khenkhatte Sinsaktu ding in a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai misiangthoute thopna ding, nasepna sepna ding, Khrist pumpi lamtouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai tuh ginna leh Pathian Ta theihna lam a thukituak a, piching a, Khrist tangchinna bang a i vek ua i om masiah ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi a mihingte diklouhna zekhemna bang a lepchiah pil a khem tawmtawm a om a thuhilhna huih chiteng a a langlang a sep leh mut lengleng naupang i hih nawnlouhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Itna a thutak gen a, bangkim a Amah lupen, Khrist ngei a i khanlet zawkna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah a kipan pumpi tengteng kizopna chiteng sep ziak a lemtak a suktuah leh kizomkhawm a, hiang chih in sep ding dan bang a sep chiang in pumpi a khang a itna ah amah leh amah a kilam tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin hiai Toupa ah k’on theisak hi, Jentelte a lungsim ginatlouhna uh pu a a om bang un, na om nawn mahmah ding uh ahi kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau a lungtang uh khauh ziak a theihtheihna neilou in Pathian hinna theihtheihna apan pawsiah in a om uhi; a theihtheihna uh hihmial in a om uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khenggawpta ua, sianglou chiteng hihna lam a huaiham in zautatna ah a kipumpiak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nou zaw huchibang in Khrist thu na zil kei uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thu za a amah a thuhilh a omkhin na hih peuhmah uleh, Jesu a thutak a om bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na pianken lui uh, na nidanglai hindan uh segawpsa suahkhia unla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lungsim Kha uah a thakin hongom unla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pianken thak, diktatna leh sianthouna a Pathian batpih a siampen silh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in zuaugen tawpsan in, noumau inveng chiat kiang ah thudik gen chiat un; kihiang tuah chiat na hi ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heh unla, khelh zaw khial kei un; na hehna uh ni in tumpih kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Diabol leng mun awnsam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Guta in gu nawn kei hen; tasam kiang a piakding a neih theihna ding in, a khut a thil hoih sem in gimzaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thu sia peuhmah na kam ua kipan in pawt kei hen; a khawkdan bangzel a bawlhoih ding in thu hoih peuhmah pawt zaw hen, a ngaikhete ading a hehpihna a hong hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan Pathian Kha Siangthou hih lungkham kei un, tatna ni ading in amah ah chiamteh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khatna, thangpaihna, hehna, hanna, gensiatnate leh gitlouhna tengteng tawpsan in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan kihehpih chiat a lainatna nei in om unla, Pathian in Khrista nou a hon ngaihdam bang in, noumau leng kingaidam tuahchiat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in a ta deihtakte bang in Pathian omdan zuite hi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Khrist in hon it a, namtui ding a Pathian kiang a thilpiak ding leh kithoihna ding a i sik a a kipiak bang in itna ah om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Misiangthou hita na hihman un kingaihna leh sianglou tengteng huaihamna toh, na lak uah lohkhak in omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zahmohte, thuginalou gente, chiamnuih thu nangawn huaite a kilawmlou ahi; huaite gen sang in kipahthu genzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kingaihhat leh mi thanghuai leh mi huaiham in, mi huaiham zaw milim bemi ahi, Khrist leh Pathian gam ah tanding a neikei uh chih na thei mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuamah in thuginalou peuh in hon zekhem kei uhen; huai thilte ziak in Pathian thangpaihna thumanglou tate tung ah a tungnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in amau kikoppih kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuma in mial na hi ua, tun zaw Toupa ah vak na hong hita uhi; vak tate bang in om un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vak gah tuh hoihna, diktatna leh thutak tengteng ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa kipahna lamtak bang ahi hiam zong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan mial thilhih gah nei ngeiloute ah leng panna neikei unla, pan naksang in a diklouh dan uh theisak zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A guk a a thilhih nakte uh a gen leng a zumhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh thil bangkim a diklouh dan muhtheiha om tuh vak hihlat ahi nak hi; muhtheih a om peuhmah vak ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, “Nang ihmu! hak inla, misi lak a kipan thou in. Huchi in, Khrist in vak honpe ding” chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan mihaite bang a omlou in, mipilte bang a omzaw in, na omdan uah pilvang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nite a hoihlouh ziak in hun na neih sung un a tam theipen sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in hai nuam kei unla, Toupa deihlam bang ahia chih theizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uain kham in omkei un, huai ah kideklouhna a om hi; Kha a dim in omzaw un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Phatna late, Pathian late, khalam late a kihoupih chiat a Toupa kiang a na lungtang tengteng ua ging kilawm bawl leh lasa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist min a, Pathian, Pa ngei kiang a bangkim tung a kipahthu gen gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khrist laudansiamin kiniamkhiak chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zite aw, Toupa kiang a na kiniamkhiak bang un, noumau pasalte kiang ah kiniamkhiak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khrist amah ngei pumpi hondampa hi a, saptuamte lutang a hih mah bang in pasal zi lutang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in saptuamte Khrist kiang a a kiniamkhiak bang un zite bangkim ah a pasalte uh kiang ah kiniamkhiak uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasalte aw, na zite uh it un, Khrist in saptuamte a it a, a sikua a kipiak bang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi a amau tui a sil a thu a a hih siangthou theihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi a saptuamte nin banglou, vuailou leh huchibang thil mawngmawng puloua, siangthou leh gensiatbeia omzawa, saptuamte amah leh amah thupitak a a kipiak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchibang in pasalte’n leng amau pumpi mah bang in amau zite a it ding uh ahi. Amah zi itpa amah ki-it ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kuamah in amah sa mah a haw ngeikei a, a vak in a deihthoh zaw hi, Khrist in saptuamte a vak a a deihthoh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah sa leh guh apan om, a pumpi hiangte i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huaiziak in pasal in a nu leh a pa paisan in a zi a len chinten ding a, a nih un sa pumkhat a hong hita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiai thuguk thupi ahi, himahleh ken zaw Khrist leh saptuamte thu ahi ka gen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abang abang hileh nou lak a kuapeuh in amah a ki-it bang in a zi it hen; zi mah in leng a pasal zahtak ding in pilvang hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naupangte aw, hiai thildik a hih ziak in Toupa ah na nu leh pate uh thumang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nu leh pa zahtak in” hiai thupiak chiam nei masapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Huchi in nang ading in a hoih dia, lei ah leng na damsawt ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan nou pate aw, na tate uh hih thangpai kei unla, Toupa thuzohna leh hilhna ah kem zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhate aw, Khrist thumang bang in laudansiam leh lingkawm in lungtang khat in sa dan a na pute uh thumang un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing hih kipakte maimah bang a mitmei kia venglou in, Khrist sikha bang a lungtang a Pathian deihlam hihzaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing nasem phet hilou in, Toupa nasem bang zaw a chitaktak kawm a nasem in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Michih sikha hi in noplen himahleh thil hoih a hih bangmah Toupa kiang a kipan in a ngeimah a mu nawn ding uh chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou heutute aw, huchibang in amau leh noumau heutupa van ah a om chih leh aman mi deihsak tuam a neikei chih thei in vau lou in a tung uah hih sam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tawppen in, Toupa leh a hatna thagui ah thilhihtheihna nei in hongom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Diabol zekhemnate na dou zoh theihna ding un Pathian galvan kim in kivan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I doute zaw sa leh sisan ahi kei ua, lalnate leh, thuneihnate leh tu a omlel mial tung a khovel vaihawmte leh vanmunte a kha gilou hon omte ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in ni hoihlou a na dou zohna ding un leh na hihzoh vek nung ua leng na din theihna ding un, Pathian galvan kim la un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kawng uh thutak a gak in, diktatna awmphaw zang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lemna Tanchinhoih vanzat na khe ua bun in ding un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaite ban ah ginna lum la unla, huai in migilou thal kuangthei tengteng na hihmit thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan hotdamna lukhu leh Kha namsau, Pathian thu la unla:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thumna leh ngetna chiteng in bangchiklai peuh in leng Kha ah thum un. Huai lam ah misiangthou tengteng ading in phatuamngai leh ngen bilbel in limsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tanchinhoih thuguk hangsantak a theisak ding a, ka kam ka kata thu gensaka ka om theihna ding in kei ding in leng hon ngetsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka gen ding bang hangsantaka ka gen theihna ding in. Huai Tanchinhoih palai khainiang bun ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh nou leng bangchibang in ka om hiam ka tanchin na theihtheihna ding un, Taikika, Toupa a unau deihtak leh nasempa muanhuai in bangkim a honthei sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in amah na kiang uah k’on sawl ahi, ka tanchin uh na theihna ding uleh aman na lungtang uh a khamuan theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan lemna leh ginna tel itna unaute kiang ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist tullou a itte tengteng kiang ah hehpihna om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
